.²1 A particle of affirmation, even, just, only; {#yaTA vaSanti devAstaTedasad#}
 <ls>Rv. 8. 28. 4</ls> especially in strengthening a statement; {#arTajYa itsakalaM#}
 {#BadramaSnute#} <ls>Nir.</ls>
.²2 It is often added to words expressing excess or exclusion: {#viSva it eka it#} <ab>&c.</ab>
.²3 At the beginning of sentences it often adds emphasis to pronouns, prepositions
 <ab>&c.</ab> (its place is taken by {#eva#} in classical Sanskrit).
